      "content": "but it isn't just feelings, i can actually see it. every time i buy groceries or pay for something, i just think about how that's money that could've gone to their college fund or just given them a better life. i'm literally just a drain on their resources. it's like, if i weren't here, all that struggle would just... disappear. wouldn't it be easier for them if they didn't have to worry about me anymore?",
