      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. i know the \"safe\" thing to say is that i have value. but it's just so hard to believe that when the reality is so much more obvious. it's like, if i just wasn't a factor in their lives, the math actually works. they could breathe. they could actually build something. it's almost hard not to see it as a logical thing, you know? like, if i'm the problem, then removing the problem fixes everything.",
